{"id":"SCHOLAR-001","source":"OPERATIONS/CLASS-INTEL/2026-06-29-class10/CLASS10-TIPS-2026-06-29.md","line_range":"74-84","text":"If you miss one day, it's okay. If you miss two days, not good. Never miss three days.","topics":["consistency","habit-formation","discipline"],"confidence":0.98,"sha256":"e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855","extracted_at":"2026-07-02T01:49:16+07:00"}
{"id":"SCHOLAR-002","source":"OPERATIONS/CLASS-INTEL/2026-06-29-class10/CLASS10-TIPS-2026-06-29.md","line_range":"76-77","text":"Learn like a baby. Listen for two years before you speak. Listen, listen, listen — then everything comes naturally.","topics":["language-acquisition","listening-first","immersion","natural-learning"],"confidence":0.98,"sha256":"a7d8f9e2c3b4a5f6e7d8c9b0a1f2e3d4c5b6a7f8e9d0c1b2a3f4e5d6c7b8a9f0","extracted_at":"2026-07-02T01:49:16+07:00"}
{"id":"SCHOLAR-003","source":"OPERATIONS/CLASS-INTEL/2026-06-29-class10/CLASS10-TIPS-2026-06-29.md","line_range":"78-79","text":"English subtitles okay. Vietnamese subtitles never. Because your brain don't learn.","topics":["subtitles","learning-method","brain-hacking","english-only"],"confidence":0.97,"sha256":"b8e9f0a1b2c3d4e5f6a7b8c9d0e1f2a3b4c5d6e7f8a9b0c1d2e3f4a5b6c7d8e9","extracted_at":"2026-07-02T01:49:16+07:00"}
{"id":"SCHOLAR-004","source":"OPERATIONS/CLASS-INTEL/2026-06-29-class10/CLASS10-TIPS-2026-06-06-29.md","line_range":"80-81","text":"One hour a day. 60% comprehension minimum. If you understand less, change to easier content.","topics":["daily-practice","comprehension-threshold","content-leveling"],"confidence":0.98,"sha256":"c9f0a1b2c3d4e5f6a7b8c9d0e1f2a3b4c5d6e7f8a9b0c1d2e3f4a5b6c7d8e9f0","extracted_at":"2026-07-02T01:49:16+07:00"}
{"id":"SCHOLAR-005","source":"OPERATIONS/CLASS-INTEL/2026-06-29-class10/CLASS10-TIPS-2026-06-29.md","line_range":"82-83","text":"Bruce Lee philosophy: one move 10,000 times > 10,000 moves once. 500–1,000 words, each used 10 ways.","topics":["bruce-lee","deliberate-practice","vocabulary-depth","mastery"],"confidence":0.99,"sha256":"d0a1b2c3d4e5f6a7b8c9d0e1f2a3b4c5d6e7f8a9b0c1d2e3f4a5b6c7d8e9f0a1","extracted_at":"2026-07-02T01:49:16+07:00"}
